    "body": "I will ask my users to check this.\nI'm not able to check right now but, recently I've discovered that decks appear to be going by a different PID, not sure if this is the upgrade to SDL3... `0x11ff`. Could this be the reason why this may not be working? I see that the driver is only used via a vid pid check.",
