    "body": "> If you're running a game while Steam is running, Valve recommends using Steam Input to get access to the advanced features of the Steam Deck hardware. I understand why that isn't optimal for your use case, but I'm going to go ahead and close this as unplanned for now.\r\n\r\nBut this is completely impossible unless you want your application published on steam!\r\n\r\nYou can't initialise the Steamworks API without a steam game id, nor can you access any inputs without providing a compile-time manifest.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/kmicki/SteamDeckGyroDSU/\r\n\r\nThis tool seems to read the HID frame and is intended to be used on SteamOS (with Steam Input)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
